			<key>other</key>
			<string>ほか %lld 個の小さな項目</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>%lld system items need your administrator password.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld 個のシステム項目には管理者パスワードが必要です。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>Apps move to quarantine with their leftovers, so you can restore them for %lld days.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>App は残りファイルとともに隔離へ移動するため、%lld 日間復元できます。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>Caches that rebuild themselves are deleted. Everything else goes to quarantine first, and History restores it for %lld days. Your documents and system files are always protected.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>自動的に再作成されるキャッシュは削除されます。それ以外はすべてまず隔離へ移動し、履歴から %lld 日間復元できます。書類とシステムファイルは常に保護されます。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>Folder · %lld items</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>フォルダ · %lld 項目</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>Keep removed files for %lld days</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>削除したファイルを %lld 日間保管</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>Move %lld items to the Trash?</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld 項目をゴミ箱に入れますか？</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>Moved to quarantine (restorable for %lld days)</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>隔離へ移動（%lld 日間復元可能）</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>Nothing over %@ that hasn’t been opened in %lld days. Try a smaller size.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%1$@ を超え、%2$#@days@開かれていないものはありません。サイズを小さくしてみてください。</string>
		<key>days</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%2$lld 日間</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>OpenClean stops the agent and moves its file to quarantine. You can restore it from History for %lld days; it starts again at your next login after restoring.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>OpenClean はエージェントを停止し、ファイルを隔離へ移動します。%lld 日間は履歴から復元でき、復元後は次回のログイン時に再び起動します。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>Restorable from History for %lld days</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld 日間、履歴から復元できます</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>Smart Scan looks for caches, logs and leftovers. Nothing is removed until you review it, and quarantined items can be restored for %lld days.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>Smart Scan はキャッシュ、ログ、残りファイルを探します。確認するまで何も削除されず、隔離された項目は %lld 日間復元できます。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>These items move to quarantine. You can restore them from History for %lld days; after that they are deleted.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>これらの項目は隔離へ移動します。%lld 日間は履歴から復元でき、その後は削除されます。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>undo for %lld days</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>%lld 日間元に戻せます</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
</dict>
</plist>
